{"id":"d805ec13e8dbede3","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-measure11-outer-measure-generated.md","title":"ZFC Measure11 Outer Measure Generated","display":"df-zfc-measure11-outer-measure-generated — ZFC Measure11 Outer Measure Generated","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure11-outer-measure-generated","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure11-outer-measure-generated"],"display":"df-zfc-measure11-outer-measure-generated — ZFC Measure11 Outer Measure Generated","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure11-outer-measure-generated"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure11-outer-measure-generated</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure11-outer-measure-generated — ZFC Measure11 Outer Measure Generated"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4937f229fe78bb22\" href=\"?note=4937f229fe78bb22\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md\">../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4a74b59e369ba8a3\" href=\"?note=4a74b59e369ba8a3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets\">58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu^*,\\mu,\\mathcal{A},X\\in V\">\\(\\mu^*,\\mu,\\mathcal{A},X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> is the semiring predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4a74b59e369ba8a3\" href=\"?note=4a74b59e369ba8a3\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets\">58-df-zfc-measure4-semi-ring-of-sets</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\\)</span> is the outer-measure predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4937f229fe78bb22\" href=\"?note=4937f229fe78bb22\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md\">../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11OuterMeasureGenerated}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11OuterMeasureGenerated}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}outer\\text{-}measure\\text{-}generated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11OuterMeasureGenerated}_S(\\mu^*,\\mu,\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal A,[0,\\infty])\\land\\mu(\\emptyset)=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal A^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to F(m)\\cap F(n)=\\emptyset)\\land\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\in\\mathcal A\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}{}\\to\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\right)=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(F(n))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\\land\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;\\left(\\mu^*(E)=\\inf\\left\\{\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(F(n)):F\\in\\mathcal A^\\omega\\land E\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\right\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure11\\text{-}outer\\text{-}measure\\text{-}generated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure11OuterMeasureGenerated}_S(\\mu^*,\\mu,\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4SemiRingOfSets}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal A,[0,\\infty])\\land\\mu(\\emptyset)=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal A^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to F(m)\\cap F(n)=\\emptyset)\\land\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\in\\mathcal A\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}{}\\to\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\right)=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(F(n))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{OuterMeasure}_S(\\mu^*,X)\\land\\forall E\\subseteq X\\;\\left(\\mu^*(E)=\\inf\\left\\{\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(F(n)):F\\in\\mathcal A^\\omega\\land E\\subseteq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\right\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary generated outer measure definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-outer-measure.md","s